{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56638","headline":"赠韩家郎君在家修行 · 无名氏","name":"赠韩家郎君在家修行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崇真起善立玄堂，谨奉朝昏两炷香。\n内侍孀亲行孝道，外持贞正合三光。\n常行矜悯提贫困，每施慈悲挈下殃。\n他日聪明如省悟，也应归去到仙乡。\n（同前第五六二页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}